hell, starter commands, Enter-to-send input, localized basic responses, and identified task cards. Keep GUI sources in a dedicated Gradle source set so the documented console test runner remains independent of JavaFX.\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"gradle":{"insertions":21,"deletions":0},"fxml":{"insertions":46,"deletions":0},"java":{"insertions":319,"deletions":0}}}]},{"date":"2026-09-03T00:00:00","commitResults":[{"hash":"b44a1a9faefeb721ece59dfb723537d47e741105","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Add task actions and safe persistence","messageBody":"The JavaFX transcript renders task results without controls, and a failed save can leave the in-memory list different from disk.\\n\\nAdd original-ID mark, unmark, and confirmed delete actions to structured task cards, with localized metadata for todos, deadlines, and events. Save through an atomic file replacement and roll back in-memory mutations when persistence fails. Cover search, spanning date filters, restart persistence, and rollback behavior with focused tests.\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"java":{"insertions":258,"deletions":19}}}]},{"date":"2026-09-05T00:00:00","commitResults":[{"hash":"1171d6e6b9c74757c4944cc91b98ecfd9e9a63f8","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Make chat bubbles responsive and add avatars","messageBody":"","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"fxml":{"insertions":8,"deletions":2},"java":{"insertions":287,"deletions":2}}},{"hash":"b1a411735ddde9ea12b26854b5650a933f0d8128","isMergeCommit":true,"messageTitle":"Merge branch \u0027branch-level-10\u0027","messageBody":"","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{}}]}]},"authorFileTypeContributionMap":{"ewonglh":{"java":2815,"md":948,"fxml":52,"sh":0,"bat":0,"gradle":29,"txt":0}},"authorContributionVariance":{"ewonglh":283202.56},"authorDisplayNameMap":{"ewonglh":"CS2103T-F08-1 EDMU..HONG"}}
